Apply the Manifests
kubectl apply -f deployment.yaml
kubectl apply -f service.yaml


kubectl get svc nginx-service
NAME             TYPE           CLUSTER-IP      EXTERNAL-IP      PORT(S)        AGE
nginx-service   LoadBalancer   10.96.3.25      35.234.12.100    80:31234/TCP   2m


Now, you can access Nginx from outside the cluster using:
http://35.234.12.100

